          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "大雪で新幹線が運休となり、乗客たちは駅で足止めを食った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "洪水で道路が寸断され、村人たちは一週間にわたって足止めされた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "濃霧のため空港で足止めされ、フライトが丸一日遅れた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "level dyeing",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "染色職人は媒染剤を使って足止めを施し、色落ちを防いだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "藍染めの工程では足止めが重要で、これを怠ると色が均一に定着しない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "足止めの工程を丁寧に行うことで、長年使っても色あせない布が仕上がる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
